    "id": "372637",
    "original": "医療行為により患者が死亡している場合、その医療行為に過失があれば、過失の程度を問わず、直ちに「異状死」に法的に該当しない。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "372638",
        "text": "In the case of patient death during the course of medical treatment, even if there is medical error present, it is not automatically legally considered to be an \"unusual death.\""
